flowchart LR
  Context[context:verify] --> Unit[npm test]
  Unit --> Deploy[test:deploy]
  Deploy --> Build[public Vercel build]
  Build --> CopyQA[public copy QA]
  CopyQA --> LocalProd[optional real LLM local-prod]
  LocalProd --> Push[push/merge]
  Push --> ProdSmoke[prod smoke / reliability smoke]

